                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I played 28 hours of this stupid game. When you get to \"Berlin Assault\" the part that you follow Anton, he gets killed and you have to eliminate Schneiders Assistants, this task is impossible, you empty your heavy weapons to their heads and faces and they won't die. I got killed at least 100 times trying, to no avail. Saw a video in YouTube about this mission and the YouTuber couldn't do it, he just quit.  I've been gaming since windows 95 days and never seeing a game so stupid. I used to play every \"Far Cry\" game until number five got the same way as UberSoldier II, I stop buying it and haven't played it since. We have to punish those stupid games developers by not buying the sequence of their games. When we play a game we want to have fun, not get frustrated by not been able to advance to the next mission because the game developer decided to make it impossible or almost impossible to finish a mission. At that point I just uninstalled the game, I wont try again. PLEASE, DON'T WAIST YOUR MONEY, PUNISH THE DEVELOPER.",
